<title>PORTUGAL: Yld eases to 6.8214 on Portuguese one-year bills.</title>
<headline>Yld eases to 6.8214 on Portuguese one-year bills.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield eased to 6.8214 percent, from 6.9762 percent previously, at the Treasury's sale of 14 billion escudos of 364-day bills, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>The last such sale was on September 18.</p>
<p>--LISBON BUREAU 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
